<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;min-height:11.5pt;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_ULdmO0i_UkGwMFP7MXlpIA_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Stock Awards</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On August 3, 2023, we issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_xPczLe7eCkqNB4h2n4ag9w" contextRef="Duration_8_3_2023_To_8_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_Qm2ewMixDUmtWJw3K50gIw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_GQD1K1NU9Ey_8wgBgnO2xg">15,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted common stock to our former chief financial officer. Under the terms of the employment agreement, provided employment with the Company continues from the grant date through the applicable vesting dates, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_xPczLe7eCkqNB4h2n4ag9w" contextRef="Duration_8_3_2023_To_8_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_Qm2ewMixDUmtWJw3K50gIw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="tpcs:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsToBeVestedOnEachAnniversary" scale="0" id="Narr_WRrWU5qb1EeV_biVWu6ZpA">5,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the restricted stock will vest on each of the first, second, and third anniversaries of the effective employment date of July 17, 2023. Fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_8_3_2023_To_8_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_Qm2ewMixDUmtWJw3K50gIw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_D9g8B_Cp3km8O2pprvjkuQ">111</ix:nonFraction> was measured on the date of grant based on the number of shares expected to vest and the quoted market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock. Stock-based compensation expense will be recognized ratably over the vesting period. Total recognized compensation cost related to this award for the three months ended June 30, 2026 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_S0q2uo03l0KQZ2sWwFF6qg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_iYUr3J_IyU-IDkldoOaAfA">9</ix:nonFraction>. There was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_qSIv6Dd-K0WOxC3wGsTgkw" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_FJTwLhqz3E2ETEt6jhoRGg">no</ix:nonFraction> remaining unrecognized compensation cost related to this award on June 30, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On January 24, 2025, pursuant to the 2016 Plan, we awarded <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_xPczLe7eCkqNB4h2n4ag9w" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_P7E37iFmcUu-s4ePmkLV2w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_Bn70FlHLfkGQygJsoJ4QDg">54,880</ix:nonFraction> shares, in the aggregate, of restricted common stock to our <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_eWCVHGC5QUuY8XSco77AOA" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_P7E37iFmcUu-s4ePmkLV2w" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tpcs:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfNonEmployeeDirectors" scale="0" id="Narr_h0IevPS9Q0y0Dce7f1-rCg">four</ix:nonFraction> non-employee directors. The common stock vested and become nonforfeitable on December 19, 2025. Fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_P7E37iFmcUu-s4ePmkLV2w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_CTQ6W6NmLUyxCmlBnFZSvg">180</ix:nonFraction> was measured on the date of grant based on the number of shares expected to vest and the quoted market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock. Stock-based compensation expense was recognized ratably over the vesting period. There was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_vahiw-UnS0a-GloGqELzAg" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_F6sEwtGwFUaQJKz4afsTrA">no</ix:nonFraction> remaining unrecognized compensation cost related to this award on June 30, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the announcement of our newly appointed CFO on March 31, 2025, or the transition date, the Company agreed to grant in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_FTXljDlEuUmNLZtTOYIrsQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_EiA1NFKbAECU63OGlc6dfQ">180</ix:nonFraction> restricted shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_xPczLe7eCkqNB4h2n4ag9w" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_FTXljDlEuUmNLZtTOYIrsQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_UVS32zxAjkemiloNvLOmsA">78,261</ix:nonFraction> shares, based on the stock closing price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_W8uZoWMNrE6XwZm2yqsMwg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_SJd3sXK-3k24Ge1wsjoHig" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_eNCnn1OIUUOLtptyUWgSnA">2.30</ix:nonFraction> on the transition date. The fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_FTXljDlEuUmNLZtTOYIrsQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr__085xxHek0GjFugcqTCFwA">180</ix:nonFraction> will be amortized ratably over a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_FTXljDlEuUmNLZtTOYIrsQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_E5V62dRbX0-dfquEAH1Fpw">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> vesting period, following the transition date. Stock-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_Gx84CUCL8UeCukOJetHCgg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_hOFs0XnAtEC2x4k6rylaWg">15</ix:nonFraction> was recognized for the three months ended June 30, 2026. There is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_gUyuwWqmM0OHmJ-MPBrCRQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_aSR3NKrq0ECjgncI8VsBLw">105</ix:nonFraction> of remaining unrecognized compensation cost under this award expected to be recognized over the next <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_Gx84CUCL8UeCukOJetHCgg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_VeEsGfHm006iCUU4RWvgNw">twenty-one months</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On March 6, 2026, pursuant to the 2016 Plan, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_xPczLe7eCkqNB4h2n4ag9w" contextRef="Duration_3_6_2026_To_3_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnOctober22025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_X4PR_hz8akG6lifMr4y9FQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_BTZDfJej-0mIUIc4p_AxhQ">67,049</ix:nonFraction> shares, in the aggregate, of common stock to non-employee directors as compensation awards for services rendered in fiscal year 2026 pursuant to agreements with each of the recipients. There were&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_xPczLe7eCkqNB4h2n4ag9w" contextRef="Duration_3_6_2026_To_3_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_iAa9d1OQ6EOWHdXeo8U27Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_Ridi0YBM4EydfPhALiy5Xw">18,137</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares that were vested immediately, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_3_6_2026_To_3_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnOctober22025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_X4PR_hz8akG6lifMr4y9FQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_NoTzmk8fN0ae_55V-R0BFA">48,912</ix:nonFraction> shares that will vest on October 28, 2026. Stock-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member__vgcfdGuG0Cxqc-Wkc815Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_05rKAzLzu06vMM0Lvs10Qw">68</ix:nonFraction>&#160;was recognized for the three months ended June 30, 2026. There is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_pXnJPY5THkizHo1t3VPMcA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_BXFfyvHjc06pGW5mo12yLg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_FBBS1bWblkCb4oBVH1L0IQ">90</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of remaining unrecognized compensation cost under this award expected to be recognized over the next&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us